WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.816
A class moved? Tell
people in under a minute.

2
00:00:02.816 --> 00:00:05.541
Open Quick update.

3
00:00:05.541 --> 00:00:07.523
Press Cancel or move a class.

4
00:00:07.523 --> 00:00:12.580
Say which class and what to do.

5
00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:16.630
It comes down by itself
after the day you pick.

6
00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:20.359
It shows in red across
every page in a few minutes.

7
00:00:20.359 --> 00:00:25.282
Then email the class: not
everyone checks the website.
